    refactor(transport): clear lint findings on the list work

    The socket suites share their scaffolding now: eventually, the drain
    teardown and the delegating store live in wsTestSupport, beside one
    listed conversation given as the summary a store holds and the row the
    wire must carry. validateMessage dispatches with guard ifs, its test
    asserts one object, messageHandler keeps one comment line, and the
    acceptance test runs guards first. CHANGELOG gains the list_sessions
